  "_note": "PLACEHOLDER, and the reason matters. layer_manifest.json lists blink under `expressions` alongside happy/X_X/heart, i.e. J treats it as an ARTWORK SWAP in the eye slots, not a bone clip. The .anim format also has only UNIFORM scale, so this shrinks the eye in both axes instead of squashing it. Kept so the six-clip gate can run end to end; replace with an expression swap or add sx/sy to the format. Reported as a contract gap.",
